flowchart TD
    A[Start] --> B[Read account number]
    B --> C{Empty?}
    C -- Yes --> D[Show error]
    C -- No --> E[Create ValidationService]
    E --> F{Format valid?}
    F -- No --> G[Show invalid account]
    F -- Yes --> H{Account exists?}
    H -- No --> I[Show missing account]
    H -- Yes --> J[Call Client.viewTransactionHistory]
    J --> K[Clear table model]
    K --> L[Loop through returned transaction strings]
    L --> M[Split string into date, type, amount]
    M --> N{Split has 3 parts?}
    N -- Yes --> O[Add row to table]
    N -- No --> P[Skip row]
    O --> Q{More transactions?}
    P --> Q
    Q -- Yes --> L
    Q -- No --> R[End]
    D --> R
    G --> R
    I --> R
